nd various specialized properties. The company was formerly known as REIT Management & Research Inc. and changed its name to The RMR Group Inc. in October 2015. The RMR Group Inc. was founded in 1986 and was incorporated on May 28th, 2015 in Maryland, USA and is headquartered in Newton, Massachusetts."}}